@format 1
@id ui-event.ptab-lock-current-change
@title Current source lock change
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@event-ref cs|PMainArea/PTabSurface.cs|PTabLockAttach|pList|PListLockChange|1
@entry input
@summary Disable each tab's mutable editor surfaces while its current source is locked by accepted work.
@tag source lock
@tag PTabSurface
@alias surface = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PTabSurface

[input] Current-row lock state changes <input>
- Receive the current source's locked state from the tab list @ surface.PTabLockAttach
> apply

[apply] Synchronize editor availability <process>
- Disable every attached processing, inspector, group, section, and export surface when locked; enable them when unlocked @ surface.PTabLockAttach
> output

[output] Editor state synchronized <output>
= The active tab cannot mutate settings that belong to a submitted source, while Preview and list navigation remain available.
! Code binding: cs|PMainArea/PTabSurface.cs|PTabLockAttach|pList|PListLockChange|1
